# Rope ({G} Equipment, Equip {3}): "Equipped creature gets +1/+2, has reach, and can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 613.4c, 509.1b). Memnite equipped on turn 1 is a 2/3 with reach
# (a keyword it did not have); Bot2 may not put two creatures in front of it (a refusal that is possible otherwise: the plain Memnite beside it is double-blocked in the same declaration) but one may block it.
# The unequipped Memnite is double-blocked by two creatures, so the limit is Rope's, not the attackers' in general.

