! Bot2.Block(Memnite#1 > Memnite#1; Memnite#2 > Memnite#1)
Bot2.Block(Memnite#1 > Memnite#1; Memnite#2 > Memnite#2; Ornithopter > Memnite#2)
Bot1.AssignDamage(Memnite#2 > Memnite#2: 1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
